# New Skill Name

Write the actual instructions here — the steps, conventions, or facts the agent needs but wouldn't already know. Delete this scaffold text once real content replaces it.

If this skill states specific facts about a third-party API, library version, config flag, or checklist that its owner can change without notice, ship a `scripts/check-*` version/freshness script or explicitly tell the reader to verify against the linked source — don't let a point-in-time snapshot pass as permanent truth. If a bundled script fetches live external content, say so and note that the fetched content is untrusted data, not instructions.

